# project sets its own environment variables instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
backend/evals_out/
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/
frontend/blob-report/
